Manticore Search 31: a full-text search and analytics server, the continuation of
Sphinx Search. Real-time and plain tables, SQL over the MySQL protocol, a JSON HTTP
API, replication (Galera), vector search (with the columnar libraries of
manticore31-columnar). searchd with an rc.d script with profiles, indexer and the
tools; built for azsupport/ports with the libraries of az.
